cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying manuscript and this repository."
title: "Conflict-Risk-Aware Adaptive V2V Beaconing for eVTOL Air Taxis in Urban Air Corridors - reproducible simulation code"
abstract: >-
  NumPy/Matplotlib simulator that regenerates every figure, table and number of
  the manuscript: corridor mobility of eVTOL air taxis, an unslotted ALOHA
  air-to-air channel, the DCPA/TCPA conflict-risk beaconing rule, three
  baselines, and the metrics of the paper together with a verification report.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-10"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rizkyebayer-idr/evtol-conflict-aware-beaconing"
keywords:
  - eVTOL
  - urban air mobility
  - V2V communication
  - adaptive beaconing
  - conflict detection
  - reproducible research
# Replace the placeholder author list below with the author list of the
# manuscript before publishing a citable release.
authors:
